  description: Scholars and cultivators who pursue the forbidden mysteries of Death,
    Necromancers seek dominion over the boundary separating the living from the departed.
    Their experiments have produced both extraordinary discoveries and unspeakable
    horrors. The Empire regards their practices with considerable suspicion, for
    mastery over death rarely comes without sacrifice.
